{
  "contract": "fleet",
  "about": "The reserve and room on one account (spec flow-cli-core 1.1b 'The reserve and the spend-down window' and 'Room on an account'). input.policy is one resolved account policy; input.windows is the ledger's windows object, or null when the account has no ledger. Every window is read with readWindow first. effectiveReservePct is 0 when the seven_day entry has a resetsAt and resetsAt - spendDownWindowHours <= now < resetsAt, else reservePct (at or after resetsAt the reading has expired: the window reset, so the reserve applies again). fiveHourRoom is false when the five_hour reading is rejected or usedPct >= 100, null with no reading, else true. weeklyRoom is the same for seven_day against 100 - effectiveReservePct. When input.model is given, modelRoom checks the window 'model:<model>' against 100 with no reserve.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no ledger: the reserve is the policy's and room is unknown",
      "input": {
        "now": "2026-09-26T16:00:00.000Z",
        "policy": { "id": "personal", "role": "main", "reservePct": 50, "spendDownWindowHours": 24, "scope": { "repos": [] } },
        "windows": null
      },
      "expected": { "effectiveReservePct": 50, "fiveHourRoom": null, "weeklyRoom": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "main below its reserve has room",
      "input": {
        "now": "2026-09-26T16:00:00.000Z",
